    "id": "question-dialog-v1",
    "input_domain": {
      "directed": "56 cases: all sets 0/1/2 choices, ESC and upper/lower second-byte hotkeys, ignored keys, message geometry variants, event codes 0x0900/01/02/FF after an ignored key so the event branch executes.",
      "randomized": "100 cases, seed 0x29970791; sets 0..2, printable ASCII messages sized for screen/character width, screens 320/640/800 by 200/400/600, line-height 8..19, character-width 6..12, pending-key prefixes and at most one complete eight-word 0x09xx event.",
      "fixture": "Private DOS labels/tables and ctype remain from original module; host input/display/timer are modeled. Original string/font measurement, ctype, rectangle sizing/clipping and event-return logic execute; 0x09xx event returns its low byte."
